      "text": "Step 1: To find the value of \\(d\\), we can use the properties of the sine function and its periodicity. We know that \\(\\sin(x)\\) is an odd function, meaning \\(\\sin(-x) = -\\sin(x)\\). This property will help us determine the coefficients in the given equation.",
