      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: When \\(x = 0\\), \\(\\sin(0) = 0\\), so \\((\\sin 0)^7 = 0^7 = 0\\). Also, \\(\\sin(7 \\cdot 0) = \\sin(0) = 0\\), \\(\\sin(5 \\cdot 0) = \\sin(0) = 0\\), \\(\\sin(3 \\cdot 0) = \\sin(0) = 0\\), and \\(\\sin(0) = 0\\). Therefore, the equation simplifies to:\n\\[0 = a \\cdot 0 + b \\cdot 0 + c \\cdot 0 + d \\cdot 0.\\]\nThis does not provide information about \\(d\\) directly since it equals 0 for any \\(a, b, c, d\\).",
      "z": 3.2374264253353386
